00.00000, 000.00000␀Receiver␀␀␀␀Found automatically: when the GPS does not answer at this speed, the device tries the others and keeps the one that works. This is where it starts.␀Serial speed␀␀␀␀The GPS rests between position checks and wakes on its own. It stays awake while the map, this page or Discover is open. The battery saver turns this on too.␀␀␀Save battery␀␀␀␀Check position every␀␀␀␀Privacy␀100 m␀␀␀250 m␀␀␀1 km␀␀␀␀Exact␀␀␀Others see your advertised position shifted by up to this much; your own map keeps the real fix.␀␀␀␀Location privacy␀␀␀␀30 sec␀␀Screen timeout␀␀Layout␀␀Huge␀␀␀␀Text size␀␀␀Portrait␀␀␀␀Portrait 180␀␀␀␀Landscape␀␀␀Landscape 180␀␀␀Orientation␀Bottom␀␀Top␀Left␀␀␀␀Right␀␀␀On the left or right it becomes a rail.␀Navigation bar␀␀Launcher layout␀Start over from a preset␀␀␀␀Off leaves the time to a clock widget when Home has one.␀␀␀␀Clock in the bar on Home␀␀␀␀Screensaver␀The mesh around you instead of a dark screen. Every ring is a real packet.␀␀On battery, show it for␀Always on when connected to power␀␀␀The mesh stays put instead of slowly turning around you.␀␀␀␀Keep north up␀␀␀Preview screensaver␀î‚º␀New messages␀␀␀␀A card with the message when one arrives while the screen is dark.␀␀At a glance␀Status bar & units␀␀Keeps your node's name off the status bar.␀␀Hide device name␀␀␀␀Distance in miles␀␀␀Temperature in Fahrenheit␀␀␀Minimal␀Moderate␀␀␀␀Strict␀␀Members log in with it to post. Up to 15 characters.␀␀␀␀Logs in as a guest. Blank lets anyone in as a guest. Up to 15 characters.␀␀␀0123456789.-␀␀␀␀Encrypted to␀␀␀␀Locked. Your pads and messages are encrypted with your passphrase. Messages that arrive while locked are kept and opened when you unlock.␀␀␀OTP Messenger␀␀␀Unlock␀␀Panic wipe␀␀%d B of pad left␀␀␀␀No chat contacts yet␀␀␀␀Add the other person as a contact first.␀␀␀␀Not available: everyone has its key␀Private channel␀No channels configured␀␀Add a private channel in Chats first.␀␀␀Use a private channel: Public uses a key everyone has, so a 